{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09541","headline":"讌郑伯璵宅 · 张谓","name":"讌郑伯璵宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正月风光好，逢君上客稀。\n晓风催鸟啭，春雪带花飞。\n堂上吹金管，庭前试舞衣。\n俸钱供酒债，行子未须归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}